---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms & refunds | 16bit.ink" description="Purchase terms and refund policy for 16bit.ink games.">
  <section class="paper-card narrow" style="text-align:left">
    <h1>Terms &amp; refunds</h1>
    <p><em>Draft: have this reviewed before launch.</em></p>
    <h3>Purchases</h3>
    <p>A full-game purchase is a one-time payment that unlocks all current and future levels of that game in your browser. Payments are processed by Stripe. We never see or store your card details.</p>
    <h3>Refunds</h3>
    <p>If the game doesn't work for you, email <a href="mailto:hello@16bit.ink">hello@16bit.ink</a> within 14 days of purchase with your receipt and we'll refund you in full.</p>
    <h3>Privacy</h3>
    <p>Game progress is stored in your browser. Ownership is stored in a cookie that holds no personal data. Stripe handles your email and payment details under its own privacy policy.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
